OL,3,A'We're all broke': Would you chase a
OL,4,Afriend for #5?
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou pick up the bill for dinner, pay
OL,7,Ffor the taxi home or grab a friend's
OL,8,Fcoffee with the promise they'll pay you
OL,9,Fback later, but days go by and the
OL,10,Fmoney never arrives.
OL,12,FAt what point do you ask them for it
OL,13,Fagain and how small is too small to
OL,14,Fchase?
OL,16,FFor some, $5 (#3.70) is worth a
OL,17,Freminder, while for others, asking a
OL,18,Ffriend to repay anything under $20
OL,19,F(#15) feels more awkward than simply
OL,20,Ftaking the hit.
